          "anchor_id": "cue_s03_c1_academia_industry_built_several_priv",
          "text": "Academia and industry have built several privacy-preserving strategies, but each has limits. Encryption approaches like homomorphic encryption offer strong security yet are hard to deploy in real settings because of their technology requirements.",
