          "anchor_id": "cue_s03_c3_differential_privacy_masks_individua",
          "text": "Differential privacy masks individual values by adding noise, which can significantly reduce data utility. Linear dimensionality reduction such as Principal Component Analysis obfuscates features but may lose important nonlinear relationships.",
