          "chunk_id": "s05_c03",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s05_c3_autoencoder_fixed_across_all_experim",
          "text": "The autoencoder is fixed across all experiments so conclusions reflect the framework, not network tuning: the encoder has four layers going from N input features through hidden sizes 128, 64, and 40 down to an embedding of size M, and the decoder mirrors it back up to N.",
          "expected_role": "method",
          "cue_keywords": [
