          "chunk_id": "s05_c04",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s05_c4_every_layer_relu_loss_mean",
          "text": "Every layer uses ReLU, the loss is Mean Absolute Error, and training uses the Adam optimizer with a learning rate of 0.0001. In the non-naive scenarios, the autoencoder becomes a multitask network that also predicts the objective variable, so the encoding is guided by the downstream prediction task.",
